-- ============================================================================
-- v1406: Seed / sample data — Training registers (v1405) for the demo project
-- ============================================================================
-- Owner request 2026-11-09: sample data where it was missing, 10 records for each Training register,
-- for SEED334-PRJ-08 (fictional "Northbridge Bank" core banking replacement, the same scenario as the
-- Cutover, Operational Readiness, Testing and Data Migration samples).
-- Dated around today (11 Nov 2026): needs analysis and the curriculum are done, materials are being written,
-- super-user (train-the-trainer) sessions are under way and end-user sessions run January to March 2027.
-- Post-go-live effectiveness evaluations are simulated after the April 2027 go-live (owner decision D9).
-- Records: strategy 1, needs 10, curriculum 10, materials 10, trainers 10, sessions 10, attendance 10, environment 10, effectiveness 10, signoff 10.
-- Vendor-neutral (rule 26), person fields are plain text. display_id is left blank so Admin ID
-- Generation assigns it (rule 16.2). Fixed hex-only ids …-4000-b04c- … b055- (ranges checked free
-- before use). ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING, and nothing is inserted if the project is missing.
-- Calculated values are worked out with the same rules as the app. The final query counts the
-- records per register, so a skipped insert is visible.
-- Prerequisites: v1405. Idempotent.
-- ============================================================================

