  ('00000000-0000-4000-b04c-000000000001', '00000000-0000-4000-9001-00000000004c', 'Training Strategy – Core Banking Replacement (Release 1)', 'How Northbridge Bank trains about 1,700 staff to use the new core banking platform before go-live.', 'draft', $j${"document_reference":"TR-STR-001","document_version":"0.7","document_owner":"Joy Akinyi","next_review_date":"2027-01-15","training_lead":"Joy Akinyi","training_start":"2026-11-02","training_end":"2027-03-31","purpose":"To make sure every affected employee can do their job on the new platform from Day 1, with training timed close to go-live and support afterwards.","objectives":"95% of affected staff trained before go-live\nPass rate of 85% or more on course assessments\nEvery branch has a certified super user\nTraining completed no more than 8 weeks before go-live","scope":"End-user training for Release 1 roles\nTrain-the-trainer for super users\nTraining environment and materials\nEffectiveness evaluation after go-live","out_of_scope":"Release 2 products\nIT support team technical training (covered by the vendor contract)","assumptions":"Training environment is ready by 4 January 2027\nManagers release staff for scheduled sessions","constraints":"Branch staff train on Tuesday and Thursday afternoons with branch cover\nNo training in the March month-end week","audiences":"Tellers and customer service\t1,180\tHigh\tClassroom by super users\nContact centre agents\t180\tHigh\tVirtual classroom and practice\nPayments operations\t90\tHigh\tClassroom\nRelationship managers\t140\tMedium\tBlended\nFinance\t55\tMedium\tClassroom\nAll staff\t2,140\tLow\tE-learning awareness","delivery_approach":"Super users are trained first and certified, then train their own branches and teams close to go-live. Role-based courses use the training environment with realistic data. E-learning covers awareness for everyone.","delivery_methods":"Classroom\tHands-on role courses\nVirtual classroom\tContact centre and remote teams\nE-learning\tAwareness and refreshers\nOn the job\tFloor walkers in go-live week","train_the_trainer":"Core trainers certify about 120 super users in November and December 2026. Each super user shadows one session before delivering alone.","curriculum_overview":"Branch operations\tTellers and customer service\t16 hours\tClassroom\nPayments operations\tPayments staff\t12 hours\tClassroom\nContact centre essentials\tAgents\t8 hours\tVirtual classroom\nPlatform awareness\tAll staff\t1 hour\tE-learning","trainer_model":"Six core trainers plus super users. Ratio of one super user to about ten learners per session.","environment_approach":"A dedicated training environment refreshed before every session from a masked copy of Mock 2 data.","training_schedule":"Train the trainer\t2026-11-02\t2026-12-18\tSuper user certification\nEnd-user training\t2027-01-11\t2027-03-26\tRole courses\nRefreshers\t2027-03-29\t2027-04-08\tPractice and quick refreshers","assessment_approach":"Every role course ends with a practical exercise in the training environment. Learners who fail repeat the exercise with their super user.","effectiveness_measures":"Reaction\tCourse rating\t4 out of 5\nLearning\tAssessment pass rate\t85%\nBehaviour\tTasks done without help 30 days after go-live\t90%\nResults\tTeller error rate after go-live\tBelow 1%","completion_criteria":"95% of target staff trained\nAll super users certified\nEvery learner who failed has re-sat","roles_and_responsibilities":"Training lead\tOwns the strategy and schedule\tJoy Akinyi\nCore trainers\tCertify super users, run specialist courses\tTraining team\nSuper users\tTrain their teams, support in go-live week\tNamed in the Trainers register","risks_mitigations":"Training environment late\tCourses cannot start in January\tWeekly environment checkpoint from December\tAhmed Hassan\nLow attendance at branch sessions\tStaff not ready\tManager accountability and make-up sessions\tAmina Diallo","glossary":"Super user\tA trained member of staff who trains and supports colleagues.\nTrain the trainer\tCourse that prepares super users to deliver training.","appendices":"Training Needs Analysis\tTraining Needs Analysis register\nCurriculum\tCurriculum register","version_history":"0.1\t2026-08-28\tJoy Akinyi\tFirst draft\n0.7\t2026-11-04\tJoy Akinyi\tSchedule aligned with the dress rehearsals","related_documents":"Change Management Strategy\tCM-STR-001\nCutover Strategy\tCUT-STR-001"}$j$),
